blocks.en:
We evaluate zero-shot transfer on Chesapeake RSC and PIE
using the same jointly trained UniFlow-RS checkpoint,
without target-specific adaptation.

We compare with UAGLNet ( Yao et al., 2026 ) and STT ( Chen et al., 2021 ) for building extraction; Mask2Former ( Cheng et al., 2022a ) and
DeepLabV3+ ( Chen et al., 2018a ) for flood change mapping;
S5 ViT-L ( Lv et al., 2026 ) and DeepLabV3+ for LoveDA;
HTC-DCNet ( Chen et al., 2023 ) and RS3DAda ( Song et al., 2024 ) for height estimation;
RS2-SAM2 ( Rong et al., 2026 ) and GeoPixel-7B-RES ( Shabbir et al., 2025 ) for referring segmentation; and S5 ViT-L and OrientedFormer-R50 ( Zhao et al., 2024a ) for rotated detection.

